# Vercel builds only two things here: the static guide page (build_guide.js ->
# public/) and the relay functions in api/. Everything below belongs to the
# local/VPS Python bot and has no business being uploaded.
#
# This file is load-bearing, not just tidiness: requirements.txt in the repo
# root makes Vercel detect the whole project as Python and fail the build with
# "No python entrypoint found" before it ever looks at package.json.

requirements.txt
*.py
vfsbot/
tests/
deploy/

config.ini
config.ini.dist
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
chrome_profile/
*.log

# Local build artifact of build_guide.py; Vercel builds its own into public/.
guide.html
